# ScrollBench - Full App Clone + Performance Testing

## Goal

Create ScrollBench as a **complete functional clone** of the main Antigravity Media Viewer with ALL existing features, PLUS additional performance testing overlay for viewport culling and frame budget optimization testing.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **User Requirement**: ScrollBench must have 100% feature parity with main app BEFORE adding performance testing features. Cannot test 1000s of images without the full feature set.

## User Review Required

> [!WARNING]
> **Critical Design Decision**: This is a MUCH larger scope than initially implemented. Need to copy entire main app structure.

**Questions for user:**
1. Should ScrollBench reuse QML files from main app (via imports) or duplicate them?
2. Do you want the performance overlay as a toggle, or always visible?
3. Should this replace the current minimal ScrollBench or be a new app?

