### Phase 4: Performance Testing Features

#### Grid Size vs Thumbnail Resolution
**CRITICAL DISTINCTION:**
- **Grid Size** (`appSettings.gridSize`): UI cell size (40-400px) - zoom level
- **Thumbnail Resolution** (`appSettings.thumbnailSize`): Image decode resolution (128-512px) - quality/performance

#### Performance Overlay Controls
- **Viewport Culling Toggle**: Enable/disable viewport-based loading
- **Frame Budget Toggle**: Enable/disable frame budget limiting
- **Frame Budget Slider**: 1-50 uploads per frame
- **Thumb Resolution Slider**: 128-512px (affects decode quality, not grid size)
- **Real-time Stats**:
  - FPS (color-coded)
  - Queue depth
  - Memory usage
  - Visible item count

