## Verification Plan

### Manual Testing
1. **Grid View**:
   - Ctrl+Wheel zoom (40-400px)
   - Click thumbnail → opens PhotoViewer
   - Folder selection loads images recursively
   
2. **PhotoViewer**:
   - Swipe left/right navigation
   - Zoom in/out (wheel, pinch, double-tap)
   - Back button returns to grid
   - Video playback works
   
3. **Performance Testing**:
   - Toggle viewport culling on/off while scrolling
   - Adjust frame budget (1-50)
   - Adjust thumb resolution (128-512px) - see FPS impact
   - Monitor queue depth and memory
   
4. **1000+ Images**:
   - Load folder with 1000+ images
   - Scroll rapidly with optimizations ON → FPS ≥30, queue <50
   - Scroll rapidly with optimizations OFF → FPS drops, queue spikes

### Success Criteria
- ✅ All main app features work (grid zoom, single view, etc.)
- ✅ Performance overlay shows real-time stats
- ✅ Can handle 1000+ images smoothly with optimizations
- ✅ Clear FPS difference between optimized/unoptimized modes
